# Inherited from Project_Aleph, unchanged. These five patterns are why 50 files (406 MB) were never
# in git upstream — and why the merge that copied this tree dropped them: a file-level copy that
# honours .gitignore reads "not versioned" as "not needed". They are neither. The code reads them
# from this directory, so they belong here on disk and out of the index, which is what these lines
# have always said.
*_observations.jsonl
*_rows.npz
*_vectors.npz
*_checkpoint.npz
*_predictions.jsonl

# Added 2026-08-09. The remaining 16 built artifacts (226 MB) match none of the patterns above, so
# they would be committed by the next `git add` on this directory. Same category, same rule: the
# pipeline makes them, `PROVENANCE.md` records what they are, git does not carry them.
*_tensor.npz
*_manifest.jsonl
*_manifest_v*.jsonl
*_pairs.jsonl
*_pairs_v*.jsonl
hpa_raw_if_expanded_manifest.json
lightmycells_pair_acquisition.json
lightmycells_pair_resolution*.json
